{"title":"2008 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/b/87bd1e18c8c64e679ee5b4cc9678688f6e7ae43a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8 \\times (6 - 4) + 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"119\" height=\"20\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/0/1e017bb81458634642e1e916aa6f29450c13b34a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 46 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 20 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 18 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 12 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 56$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"433\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can use order of operations to evaluate the expression:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/1/69124032236b91254933ede9b274be5a2763605f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8 \\times (6 - 4) + 2 = 8 \\times 2 + 2 = \\boxed {\\textbf {(C) } 18}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"304\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can subtract <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> from each answer choice, and see if the result is divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> (which works because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> plus a multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is what we are looking for in the problem:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/5/8c5256771471d987973eab67cef0fe858f36282f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$46 - 2 = 44$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"94\" height=\"15\" />, which is not a multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/d/56d5ca5642136b9db04f31fb5a7ae4ad3ccd1685.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20 - 2 = 18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"94\" height=\"15\" />, which is not a multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/9/3c95a834a81f125226a52d85402531fd88ec7a53.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$18 - 2 = 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"94\" height=\"15\" />, which is a multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/b/0cb876d10284ed26f580ed4f9ad1e1599213adc9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12 - 2 = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"94\" height=\"15\" />, which is not a multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/c/87cde540d92cdcf023f6107c68f79f507d3cb43b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$56 - 2 = 54$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"94\" height=\"15\" />, which is not a multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>The only answer choice that is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> more than a multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/b/b6bc11f3eae1220971efbd527d074bb60b1333c2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed {\\textbf {(C) } 18}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"66\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)\" title=\"2008 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)\">2008 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2008 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2008 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Problem</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2008 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2008 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2008 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2008 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2008 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2008 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_CEMC_Gau